<div data-cgap-sector="Batteries, Energy Storage &amp; EV" data-cgap-term="battery"></div><p class="lead">Lithium batteries are now in every apartment hallway, shop and parking garage, and a damaged or badly charged battery can go into thermal runaway with almost no warning. Our e-bike charging and lithium battery storage signs are among the most ordered signs we make.</p><p>This page covers the whole range: e-bike and scooter charging rules, lithium battery storage, battery energy storage systems (BESS), lead-acid battery rooms and forklift charging, EV service bays and high voltage work, EV chargers, damaged battery quarantine, and battery recycling and cell manufacturing. Every sign is 8x12 aluminum, a better choice than plastic near heat and chargers.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area il-best"><h3>Most ordered</h3><p>The signs customers in this industry order most.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-e-bike-e-scooter-battery-charging-prohibited-sign-8x12-in-rust-proof-aluminum-lithium-ion-fire-hazard-safety-sign-for-apartments-garages">E-Bike / E-Scooter Battery Charging Prohibited</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/lithium-battery-storage-danger-sign-fire-explosion-hazard-no-smoking-50-ft-clearance-8x12-aluminum-cgap-safety">Lithium Battery Storage</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-high-voltage-ev-service-in-progress-sign-8x12-in-aluminum-electric-vehicle-battery-repair-safety-sign-for-auto-shops">High-Voltage EV Service in Progress</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-battery-energy-storage-system-sign-high-voltage-authorized-personnel-only-bess-electrical-hazard-sign-rust-resistant-aluminum-12x8-by-cgap-safety">Battery Energy Storage System (BESS)</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>E-bike and lithium battery charging</h3><p>Charging rules for apartments, garages, shops and offices. 98 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the rack frame at lift height beside the e-bike charging rack, at eye or hand height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-e-bike-e-scooter-battery-charging-prohibited-sign-8x12-in-rust-proof-aluminum-lithium-ion-fire-hazard-safety-sign-for-apartments-garages">E-Bike / E-Scooter Battery Charging Prohibited</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/lithium-battery-storage-danger-sign-fire-explosion-hazard-no-smoking-50-ft-clearance-8x12-aluminum-cgap-safety">Lithium Battery Storage</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-lithium-forklift-sign-cgap-w14257-812">Lithium Forklift</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-e-bike-rack-lift-sign-cgap-c14404-812">E-Bike Rack Lift</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Battery energy storage systems (BESS)</h3><p>BESS containers, cabinets and the fence around them. 273 signs. Typical spot: On the thermal management skid beside the pump coupling guard.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-battery-energy-storage-system-sign-high-voltage-authorized-personnel-only-bess-electrical-hazard-sign-rust-resistant-aluminum-12x8-by-cgap-safety">Battery Energy Storage System (BESS)</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-bess-coolant-pump-drive-sign-cgap-w00245-812">BESS Coolant Pump Drive</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-bess-bollards-sign-cgap-c05049-812">BESS Bollards</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-bess-knox-box-sign-cgap-n15689-812">BESS Knox Box</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Battery rooms and forklift charging</h3><p>Lead-acid rooms, watering stations and charging areas. 100 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the wall at the battery cover station.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/battery-room-danger-sign-sulfuric-acid-electric-shock-hazard-8x12-aluminum-osha-compliant-cgap-safety">Battery Room</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/battery-charging-area-danger-sign-hydrogen-gas-no-smoking-or-open-flames-8x12-aluminum-osha-nfpa-compliant-cgap-safety">Battery Charging Area</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-forklift-battery-sign-cgap-w14254-812">Forklift Battery</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-forklift-battery-cover-sign-cgap-c22393-812">Forklift Battery Cover</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>EV service and high voltage</h3><p>Service bays where high voltage packs are worked on. 80 signs. Typical spot: On the service bay barricade or the lift post next to the vehicle with the leaking pack.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-high-voltage-ev-service-in-progress-sign-8x12-in-aluminum-electric-vehicle-battery-repair-safety-sign-for-auto-shops">High-Voltage EV Service in Progress</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-ev-pack-coolant-leak-sign-cgap-w02643-812">EV Pack Coolant Leak</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-ev-battery-pack-lift-sign-cgap-c10637-812">EV Battery Pack Lift</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-ev-lift-bay-sign-cgap-n14002-812">EV Lift Bay</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>EV chargers</h3><p>Public and fleet charging stations. 62 signs. Typical spot: On dispenser.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-megawatt-charger-sign-8x12-aluminum">Megawatt Charger</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-charger-cable-sign-cgap-w01848-812">Charger Cable</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-bay-charger-connector-sign-cgap-c14134-812">Bay Charger Connector</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-charger-filter-sign-cgap-n21207-812">Charger Filter</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Damaged battery quarantine</h3><p>Holding areas for damaged, swollen or recalled batteries. 130 signs. Typical spot: Salvage lot and dealer storage area.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-flood-damaged-ev-storage-sign-8x12-aluminum">Flood-Damaged EV Storage</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-ev-pack-damaged-service-plug-sign-cgap-w07444-812">EV Pack Damaged Service Plug</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-damaged-pack-ramp-sign-cgap-c14001-812">Damaged Pack Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-damaged-module-tote-sign-cgap-n17573-812">Damaged Module Tote</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Battery recycling and disassembly</h3><p>Pack teardown, shredding and sorting lines. 56 signs. Typical spot: Dryer access and discharge.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-black-mass-dryer-sign-8x12-aluminum">Black Mass Dryer</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-battery-shredder-feed-rolls-sign-cgap-w01047-812">Battery Shredder Feed Rolls</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-sorting-line-noise-sign-cgap-c21714-812">Sorting Line Noise</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-battery-shredder-feed-conveyor-sign-cgap-n22488-812">Battery Shredder Feed Conveyor</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Cell manufacturing and testing</h3><p>Formation, test chambers and cell production. 283 signs. Typical spot: Press loading station.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-cell-hot-press-sign-8x12-aluminum">Cell Hot Press</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-electrode-slitter-sign-cgap-w14337-812">Electrode Slitter</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-test-chamber-door-sign-cgap-c02693-812">Test Chamber Door</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-cell-reject-bin-sign-cgap-n06463-812">Cell Reject Bin</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Where should an e-bike charging sign go?</summary><p>Post them wherever tenants or staff might charge a battery indoors: building entrances, hallways, stairwells, bike rooms and garages. Search &quot;e-bike charging&quot; to see the options.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for battery energy storage systems?</summary><p>Yes, including BESS container doors, high voltage and authorized personnel signs. Search &quot;BESS&quot; or &quot;energy storage&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>What signs does an EV service bay need?</summary><p>Typical postings cover high voltage work in progress, keeping untrained staff clear and the battery disconnect steps. Search &quot;EV service&quot; to see them.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Where should an e-bike charging sign go?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Post them wherever tenants or staff might charge a battery indoors: building entrances, hallways, stairwells, bike rooms and garages. Search \"e-bike charging\" to see the options."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for battery energy storage systems?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including BESS container doors, high voltage and authorized personnel signs. Search \"BESS\" or \"energy storage\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs does an EV service bay need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type":